# Phase 157.0c: RUNS pressed while acquisition is on its wide frame.
# The first 4-hour soak (2026-11-16) pressed RUNS 45 s after PLANET LOCK,
# while acquisition was still on 3840x2160. The sweep started wide and
# the lock put 640x480 back under it, 28 times in 30. The sequence now
# waits for acquisition to end, then focuses and runs on the profile's
# frame. The soak checks the same thing on every cycle.
name    Acquire then runs: the sequence waits for the lock
timeout 900
rig     AutorunRuns=1
rig     AutorunGapSec=20
rig     AutorunRefocusEvery=1
rig     AutorunSeeingPct=0
rig     AutorunMinAltDeg=10

profile star.ini focuser position=168000

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Acquire then runs
wait   3
goto   Kochab
expect 30  [PROFILE] Created 'kochab.ini' for 'Kochab' from the Star profile
expect 120 SEARCHING
wait   3
press  PLANET LOCK
expect 15  [ACQUIRE] acquisition: wide frame to find and calibrate
wait   3
press  RUNS
expect 10  [AUTORUN] start: 1 runs
expect 10  [AUTORUN] waiting for acquisition to end before focus or a run
absent 3   [AUTORUN] focus before run
expect 120 [ACQUIRE] locked: the profile's frame, on the target
expect 10  [AUTORUN] acquisition has ended: going on
expect 10  [AUTORUN] focus before run
expect 600 [AUTORUN] end:
expect 10  [BUTTON] RUNS -> RUNS
shot   after-runs
